{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remnants Of The Witch is a story-heavy RPG game. It takes place in a magic-based 1930s-inspired setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience a story\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story follows Mari, who joins a witch-hunting organization to save her friend Annie. Experience her journey as she learns more about herself, her companions, and the world of witch-hunting she has entered. Joined by her comrades, she will go on various missions to defeat the witch threat that has suddenly appeared.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spend time with squadmates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-02_055135.png?t=1745252840\" />\u00a0Spend quality time with your teammates, unlocking new abilities and learn more about them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-01_143443.png?t=1745252840\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the city of sthalgrave encounter new people and interesting side-stories to experience. Watcht the city change as the story progresses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452160?t=1745252840","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452160?t=1745252840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/c4ed5c3948d57b3724d1e52c9a253652f6889f7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745252840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452160/c4ed5c3948d57b3724d1e52c9a253652f6889f7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745252840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description"